# cmd.exe resolves GOTO by seeking to a byte offset, so a .cmd checked out with
# LF endings can jump to the wrong place - and both scripts here use labels.
# Forcing CRLF makes that independent of whoever clones and of their settings,
# including in the ZIP GitHub builds from this repository.
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.md   text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.bin binary
